Modifications made by WJBFks on 2026-11-05:

  - package renamed from @linxin666/dsh-remote-web-ui to wj-dsh-remote;
  - plugin row id renamed from "remote-web-ui" to "wj-dsh-remote";
  - route prefixes renamed:
      /api/pair   -> /api/wj-pair
      /pair-accept -> /wj-pair-accept
      /pair-app    -> /wj-pair-app
      /pair-ping   -> /wj-pair-ping
      /remote      -> /wj-remote
  - on-disk and in-browser state renamed to the wj-* namespace:
      remote-web-ui-devices.json  -> wj-dsh-remote-devices.json
      remote-web-ui-registry/     -> wj-dsh-remote-registry/
      x-dsh-remote-device header  -> x-wj-remote-device
      dsh_pair cookie             -> wj_dsh_pair
      dsh-remote-force-desktop    -> wj-dsh-remote-force-desktop

Behavioral changes in this revision (0.1.0):

  - relay defaults to false (upstream defaults to true, which makes every
    install claim a lease on dsh-market.com and publish a public hostname);
  - the anonymous daily telemetry heartbeat is disabled (upstream posts to
    https://dsh-market.com/api/telemetry/event);
  - the browser half's relative /api/pair/* calls were rewritten to
    /api/wj-pair/* so they follow the renamed route prefix.

The upstream deprecation notice still applies: the browser-facing remote control path this
fork preserves is retired upstream in favour of @linxin666/dsh-remote-bridge
(native phone app protocol).
